---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Travel
permalink: /travel/
description: "How to get to Harpswell, Maine: flying, the train from Boston, or driving in; airport rides and getting around; and the wedding shuttle and where to park."
---
<section class="section section--scene" style="--scene:var(--scene-harbor)">
  <div class="wrap center stack">
    <span class="label eyebrow">Getting here</span>
    <h1>Getting to Harpswell</h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ site.travel.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- Journey order (Patrick, 2026-09-24: "kinda seems out of order"): how you
        arrive -> rides from the airport and around town -> getting to the wedding
        itself -> things to do. Three rows of three. -#}
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Fly</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ site.travel.airport.name }}</strong>: {{ site.travel.airport.note }}</p>
        <p class="note">Alternate: {{ site.travel.alt.name }}, {{ site.travel.alt.note }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Train</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ site.travel.train.name }}</strong>: {{ site.travel.train.note }}</p>
        <p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ site.travel.train.url }}">More info &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Drive</h3>
        <p>{{ site.travel.drive }}</p>
        {#- inline margin/padding: the card rule that pins a trailing link row to the
            baseline would otherwise float this note to the bottom of the card -#}
        <p class="note" style="margin-top:0; padding-top:0">Parking: {{ site.travel.parking }} <a href="#parking">See where to park</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider" style="margin-top:34px"><img src="/assets/svg/poppy-divider.svg" alt="" width="110" height="59"></div>

    <div class="center stack" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <h2>Airport rides &amp; getting around</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width:720px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto">{{ site.gettingAround.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {#- No call button here: the Brunswick Taxi card right beside it has one. -#}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>To &amp; from the airport</h3>
        <p>{{ site.travel.transfers.toInn }}</p>
        <p style="margin:0">{{ site.travel.transfers.toAirport }}</p>
      </div>
      {% for o in site.gettingAround.options %}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>{{ o.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ o.note }}</p>
        {% if o.phone %}<p style="margin:0 0 8px"><a class="btn btn--ink" href="tel:{{ o.phone | replace('(','') | replace(')','') | replace(' ','') | replace('-','') }}">Call {{ o.phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        <p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ o.url }}">More info &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {#- The wedding shuttle's home (Patrick, 2026-09-24): venue, stops, and the
        parking pins; the schedule line rides in the lead. Stay and the FAQ link to
        #shuttle. -#}
    <div class="divider" style="margin-top:34px"><img src="/assets/svg/poppy-divider.svg" alt="" width="110" height="59"></div>

    <div class="center stack" id="shuttle" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <h2>Getting to the wedding</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width:720px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto">{{ site.travel.shuttle.lead }} {{ site.travel.shuttle.schedule }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>The venue</h3>
        <p>{{ site.venue.name }}<br>{{ site.venue.address }}</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn--ink" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ site.venue.mapsQuery }}">Open in Maps →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Where the shuttle stops</h3>
        <ul class="stops">
          {% for st in site.travel.shuttle.stops %}<li>{{ st.name }}{% if st.tag %} <span>{{ st.tag }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p style="margin:0"><a href="/stay/">Our room blocks &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" id="parking">
        <h3>Driving? Park at the Grange</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ site.parkingLot.name }}</strong><br>{{ site.parkingLot.address }}</p>
        <p>{{ site.parkingLot.directions }}</p>
        {% include "partials/parking-pins.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--olive">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div class="center stack" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <span class="label eyebrow">While you're here</span>
      <h2>Things to do around Harpswell</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for t in site.thingsToDo %}
      <div class="card card--olive">
        <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
        <p style="margin:0{% if t.url %} 0 8px{% endif %}">{{ t.note }}</p>
        {% if t.url %}<p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ t.url }}">More &rarr;</a></p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
